WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Magellan said he wants to research about pre-colonial PH

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
The signal fractures — time bleeding at the edges.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Frame drops. Memory corruption detected.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
[glitch tone]

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
A chrono-loop begins. You have been here before.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:00.000
The clock unravels. Seconds fold into static.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:20.000
[signal lost]

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Reconstruction incomplete. Timestamp: unknown.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:03:00.000
The glitch is not an error — it is the message.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:20.000
[end of recoverable data]

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:40.000
Before the flag, before the cross — there was the wave.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:04:00.000
The barangay remembers what the archive erased.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:20.000
[carrier wave detected]

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:40.000
Lapulapu did not read the footnotes.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:05:00.000
1521: a year that flickers in and out of consensus.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:20.000
The galleon trade routes as data pipelines.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:40.000
[packet loss 47%]

00:05:40.000 --> 00:06:00.000
Alibata encoded in corrupted sectors.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:20.000
The babaylan transmits on frequencies you cannot tune.

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:40.000
Chronological order is a colonial construct.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:07:00.000
[buffering]

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:20.000
You are watching a reenactment of a reenactment.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:40.000
The original signal has long been overwritten.

00:07:40.000 --> 00:08:00.000
Tagalog, Visayan, Ilocano — parallel processes.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:20.000
[interference pattern recognized]

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:40.000
The sea does not forget the outrigger.

00:08:40.000 --> 00:09:00.000
Time here is not linear. It spirals.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:20.000
[audio desync: +3.2 seconds]

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:40.000
Precolonial gold: cached before the cache was cleared.

00:09:40.000 --> 00:10:00.000
The conquistador as a virus in the operating system.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:20.000
[system overload]

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:40.000
Magellan was a navigator. Also a bug.

00:10:40.000 --> 00:11:00.000
The cross planted in Cebu — a foreign dependency.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:20.000
[checksum error]

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:40.000
Memory leak in the colonial subroutine.

00:11:40.000 --> 00:12:00.000
The archipelago refuses to render as one object.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:20.000
[rendering incomplete]

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:40.000
7,641 islands. 7,641 simultaneous broadcasts.

00:12:40.000 --> 00:13:00.000
The datu's decree as compressed data.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:20.000
[decompression failed]

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:40.000
Bathala watching from outside the frame.

00:13:40.000 --> 00:14:00.000
Time dissolves into archipelagic time.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:20.000
[frame rate: 0.5fps]

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:40.000
The manunggul jar: a vessel for the dead and the living.

00:14:40.000 --> 00:15:00.000
Anito in the machine.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:20.000
[signal rerouted]

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:40.000
The colonial archive as a corrupted hard drive.

00:15:40.000 --> 00:16:00.000
You are the glitch between two epochs.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:20.000
[recovery mode initiated]

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:40.000
Baybayin script flickers across the screen.

00:16:40.000 --> 00:17:00.000
Pre-colonial trade with China, Java, Borneo — open ports.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:20.000
[latency: 500 years]

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:40.000
The kapre watches from a tree older than the internet.

00:17:40.000 --> 00:18:00.000
Tikling birds navigating temporal interference.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:20.000
[buffer overflow]

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:40.000
The babaylan's chant as source code.

00:18:40.000 --> 00:19:00.000
History is a file that has been saved over many times.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:20.000
[read error on sector 1521]

00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:40.000
What was lost is still transmitting, faintly.

00:19:40.000 --> 00:20:00.000
The mangrove does not need a nation-state to exist.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:20.000
[signal: weak but persistent]

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:40.000
Prehispanic pottery found in a JPEG artifact.

00:20:40.000 --> 00:21:00.000
The ocean as broadband — always connected.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:20.000
[upload: incomplete]

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:40.000
You arrived at this moment through 30,000 years of drift.

00:21:40.000 --> 00:22:00.000
The data is the land. The land is the data.

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:20.000
[compression artifacts: cultural]

00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:40.000
Katipunan as distributed network.

00:22:40.000 --> 00:23:00.000
Rizal wrote in cursive and in code.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:20.000
[decryption in progress]

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:40.000
The pixel bleeds where the machete once fell.

00:23:40.000 --> 00:24:00.000
Every glitch is a ghost asking to be heard.

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:20.000
[transmission from 1896]

00:24:20.000 --> 00:24:40.000
The revolution was not televised. It was buffered.

00:24:40.000 --> 00:25:00.000
Andres Bonifacio: root user.

00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:20.000
[privilege escalation detected]

00:25:20.000 --> 00:25:40.000
The bahay kubo as open-source architecture.

00:25:40.000 --> 00:26:00.000
Palay growing in the RAM of the terraces.

00:26:00.000 --> 00:26:20.000
[clock desynchronized]

00:26:20.000 --> 00:26:40.000
The moon has always kept Philippine Standard Time.

00:26:40.000 --> 00:27:00.000
Walay katapusan — without end, without exit.

00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:20.000
[loop detected]

00:27:20.000 --> 00:27:40.000
The screen is the sea. You are swimming.

00:27:40.000 --> 00:28:00.000
Phosphorescent data trailing behind the fishing boat.

00:28:00.000 --> 00:28:20.000
[bioluminescence: digital]

00:28:20.000 --> 00:28:40.000
The aswang was here before the server.

00:28:40.000 --> 00:29:00.000
You cannot reboot what was never booted.

00:29:00.000 --> 00:29:20.000
[final transmission]

00:29:20.000 --> 00:29:40.000
There is no end state. Only continuation.

00:29:40.000 --> 00:30:00.000
[signal: eternal]

